[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4202.229, "timestamp": "01:10:02", "text": "這條規則，也想在我的頻道上遵守它。是的，對觀眾來說，你可以這麼做，但前提是不能讓其他人感到不舒服。紅線就在那裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4208.55, "timestamp": "01:10:08", "text": "影片裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.79, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "你差點就說出那個「B」開頭的字了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4219.831, "timestamp": "01:10:19", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "And you was selling the devil’s lettuce"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4243.83, "timestamp": "01:10:43", "text": "。什麼B開頭的字？  什麼？但即使我說了那個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4247.149, "timestamp": "01:10:47", "text": "髒話，或者所有那些會引起爭議的詞語等等，我也會進行審查。用其他字詞代替，像是鳳梨、魚之類的，或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4250.87, "timestamp": "01:10:50", "text": "類似的東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.63, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "。我就是這麼審查的。即使我真的很想說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4257.99, "timestamp": "01:10:57", "text": "那個髒話，我也會"}]